<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $2.55 million Paris Open tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat 5-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-3 6-2  </p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 6-Boris Becker (Germany) 6-3 5-7 6-4</p>
<p>13-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>Stefan Edberg (Sweden) beat 3-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-2, Muster retired hurt.  </p>
<p>Fernon Wibier (Netherlands) beat 14-Alberto Costa (Spain) 3-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) 6-4 6-4  </p>
<p>12-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 6-4 7-5  </p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 6-4 3-6 6-4  </p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat 10-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>(Ends second round results)</p>
